flowchart LR
    Contractor[Contractor tablet] --> Web[React/Vite web app]
    Homeowner[Homeowner display] --> Web

    Web -->|REST / NDJSON| Express[Express server]

    subgraph Backend[TypeScript backend]
        Express --> Routers[Application and copilot routers]
        Routers --> Commands[Application commands]
        Routers --> Turn[Copilot turn orchestration]
        Routers --> Extract[Document extraction routes]
        Routers --> Review[Reviewer routes]

        Turn --> Guardrails[Guardrail checks]
        Guardrails --> LLM[Anthropic LLM adapter]
        Turn --> Tools[Copilot tools]
        Tools --> Calculator[Deterministic payment calculator]
        Tools --> Catalog[Loan product catalog]

        Extract --> OCR[OCR and document adapters]
        Extract --> ExtractionModel[Extraction model]
        ExtractionModel --> Provenance[Quote and geometry verification]

        Review --> ReviewerStore[Review and discrepancy logic]
        Commands --> Store[Application store]
        Calculator --> Store
        Provenance --> Store
        ReviewerStore --> Store
    end

    Store --> JSONL[(Audit JSONL)]
    Store --> Files[(Uploads and extracted fixtures)]
    LLM --> Anthropic[(Anthropic API)]
    OCR --> PDF[(PDF / Tesseract / Textract)]
